## In a block

A block shows its plots as well as its sheets:

| Month | Revenue | Cost |  Measured |
| :---- | ------: | ---: | --------: |
| May   |     170 |  100 | 168.8(20) |
| Mar   |     150 |   90 | 149.1(10) |


